{
  "description": "A request in the CBOR binding is read only in core deterministic encoding with every item, at every depth and inside ignored members, in the request data model: null, false, true, text, unsigned integers up to 2^53 - 1, arrays and maps with text keys (#529). Anything else is request_malformed. Generated by python/scripts/generate_cbor_request_model_vectors.py.",
